// WHERE on the partially mapped unmapped.foo matches its mapped leg (id 8) and its unmapped _source leg (id 1) alike. Rows where it is
// multivalue - id 5 ([arr1, arr2] from _source) and id 9 ([mfa, mfb] mapped) - make the == comparison throw the single-value error and
// are treated as null, so they never match; only the two single-valued equals survive.
multiIndexWhereMatchesEitherLegOfPartialField
